        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "So, this really is the only entrance to the cave, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "Mhm. It's like a maze inside the cave, but the village elders have brought me here several times before, including when I succeeded the previous chief..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "...Um, I might just be imagining things, but don't you think the shouts from inside the forest are getting louder...?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Things are only going to get worse if we run into any more delays."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Carol, you know your way around inside the cave, right? I'd like you to go inside and retrieve the treasure right now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "Huh? What about you..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "I'll stay at the entrance."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "No way!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Huh? Carol..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#4",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "You're going to face the bounty hunters alone? That's too dangerous! You'll be..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "If I can't help you secure that treasure, I'd be letting down the entire village, and you as well."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "...But, I don't want to lose you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "This... isn't the time or place for you to be playing hero...!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "What's wrong with playing the hero?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "'Even with their hearts impaled by the enemy's blades, the King's knights still held on to their spears.'"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "I refuse to run away."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "Grani..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Besides, Carol, this isn't just my battle."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "It's also your battle. Perhaps you will run into dangers along the way, but as long as we can restore peace to this land..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "We must face our duties head-on."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "I trust that you'll find the treasure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "But... if I'm alone..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "The treasure..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Trust me."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "No matter what, I'll protect you. Back when I rescued you, I promised that nobody would ever hurt you again."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "Not even a single strand of hair on your head."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#5",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "Even though you're just a kid..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Grani",
        "text": "I'm no such thing... I'm just vertically challenged!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "avg_npc_003",
            "name2": "char_220_grani#3",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "Haha!"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Carol",
        "text": "...Mm, I'll do as you said, Grani."
    },
